DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
10580::$$$message_0082_0000_0000$$$::Today's task: shopping for necessities.::
10581::$$$message_0082_0001_0000$$$::"I'm counting on you, Shirou!"[lr]::
10582::$$$message_0082_0001_0001$$$::On the list that the manager asked me to get is wood, nails, a hammer, wood glue, red and blue paint, and to finish it off, two name tags.[lr]::
10583::$$$message_0082_0001_0002$$$::...Just so we're clear, I work part-time at Copenhagen, a liquor store.::
10584::$$$message_0082_0002_0000$$$::"Hey, don't space out.[lr]::
10585::$$$message_0082_0002_0001$$$::Should the appraiser be dozing off like that?"[lr]::
10586::$$$message_0082_0002_0002$$$::That would be Ms. Neko, the one in charge of money, standing by the everyday goods section.[lr]::
10587::$$$message_0082_0002_0003$$$::She has a saw in one hand and a machete in the other. Very cool. She's a dual wielder who would make even a serial killer go pale from fright.::
10588::$$$message_0082_0003_0000$$$::"I know, I know, so please don't swing those around in both hands like that!"[lr]::
10589::$$$message_0082_0003_0001$$$::I can't let my guard down just because we're in a department store. You never know where the dead end trap is hiding...!::
10590::$$$message_0082_0004_0000$$$::"Hey[line len=2]which one of these shiny things is more sharp?[lr]::
10591::$$$message_0082_0004_0001$$$::I'm used to using sharp tools and all, but I've never used anything this big. I don't quite get the appeal."[lr]::
10592::$$$message_0082_0004_0002$$$::"It depends on what they're supposed to be used for. Ms. Neko, why are we here again?"::
10593::$$$message_0082_0005_0000$$$::"I don't know. There's no way I would know what my dad is thinking.[lr]::
10594::$$$message_0082_0005_0001$$$::You'd think he's not the type to worry about stuff, eh, Emiyan? I'm a lot like him, useless as a lamp during the day...though I'd say he's on another level. Don't you get the feeling he doesn't have a thought in his head?"[lr]::
10595::$$$message_0082_0005_0002$$$::"What's wrong with that? I think that's the good part about him. He was the only one who hired me as a kid, too."::
10596::$$$message_0082_0006_0000$$$::"Oh yeah, that. That I can praise. It was a good decision for my dad.[lr]::
10597::$$$message_0082_0006_0001$$$::Hmm, that's right, he brings results when it comes to things he's picked up."[lr]::
10598::$$$message_0082_0006_0002$$$::Ms. Neko nods, while studying the temper pattern on the blade.[lr]::
10599::$$$message_0082_0006_0003$$$::Her narrow eyes are somehow even more narrow.::
10600::$$$message_0082_0007_0000$$$::"Oh, but you know, we are absolutely blood related. I've checked many times when I was in school. It's as clear as how you and Fujimura are practically family."[lr]::
10601::$$$message_0082_0007_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
10602::$$$message_0082_0007_0002$$$::Ms. Neko's analogy is hard to understand, but I can somewhat get what she's trying to say.[lr]::
10603::$$$message_0082_0007_0003$$$::In other words, they're undoubtedly father and daughter in the biological sense.::
10604::$$$message_0082_0008_0000$$$::"...Hmm. All right, I've decided on this one. I can substitute a knife for the machete, but the saw is a one-of-a-kind item.[lr]::
10605::$$$message_0082_0008_0001$$$::What do you think, Emiyan? Is this saw worth the price?"[lr]::
10606::$$$message_0082_0008_0002$$$::"It is worth the price, but it's not suitable this time. It's rustic, but that double-edged saw would be better. Even the store manager would be done in a day with that."::
10607::$$$message_0082_0009_0000$$$::"What, do you know what my dad's trying to do?"[lr]::
10608::$$$message_0082_0009_0001$$$::"I have an idea. What he hired this time is your nemesis."[lr]::
10609::$$$message_0082_0009_0002$$$::...I hope he's going to keep it behind the store.[lr]::
10610::$$$message_0082_0009_0003$$$::Knowing the old store manager, I'm scared he's going to casually let it loose in the store. I can only pray that it's not a big hunting breed.::
10611::$$$message_0082_0010_0000$$$::"Hm? My nemesis? I wonder what he's thinking, getting even more alcohol...[cacheimage storage=ネコ01f(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ネコ01f(近)] Come to think of it, there was some weird note saying to get more nihonshu.[lr]::
10612::$$$message_0082_0010_0001$$$::Hmm, nihonshu. It's too good to resist, so it'd be troubling to have such an extensive collection. [cacheimage storage=ネコ01a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=900][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ネコ01a(近)]Well, it's fine though."::
10613::$$$message_0082_0011_0000$$$::I can't let myself get discouraged that we're not talking about the same thing.[lr]::
10614::$$$message_0082_0011_0001$$$::Apparently it's more comfortable for Ms. Neko to not be on the same wavelength.[lr]::
10615::$$$message_0082_0011_0002$$$::That is the Copenhagen way. Their blood is thicker than water.::
10616::$$$message_0082_0012_0000$$$::"So, how is it going? He was saying that he doesn't just want nails, but screws too."[lr]::
10617::$$$message_0082_0012_0001$$$::"Yes, it's going a bit over budget, but it's fine.[lr]::
10618::$$$message_0082_0012_0002$$$::It's this one."::
10619::$$$message_0082_0013_0000$$$::"What the? That's too fancy. Isn't just one screwdriver enough?"[lr]::
10620::$$$message_0082_0013_0001$$$::"No, it's not. If he's going to need it anyway, he should have one set. You can never have too many tools."::
10621::$$$message_0082_0014_0000$$$::"Really? ...Hmm, if a miracle handyman like you says so. Fine. I'll pay for the rest."[lr]::
10622::$$$message_0082_0014_0001$$$::It seems like I have won a great amount of trust when it comes to errands.[lr]::
10623::$$$message_0082_0014_0002$$$::...I don't recall doing any DIY carpentry at the store, but according to the store manager, I give out that kind of vibe.::
10624::$$$message_0082_0015_0000$$$::"I would like a receipt, please. That one for Copenhagen, those tools for Hotaruzuka."[lr]::
10625::$$$message_0082_0015_0001$$$::Ms. Neko finishes paying quickly.[lr]::
10626::$$$message_0082_0015_0002$$$::Hotaruzuka is Ms. Neko's last name.[lr]::
10627::$$$message_0082_0015_0003$$$::I don't know what characters "Neko" uses in her name. She won't tell me even if I ask her, and it's still a mystery since she writes "Neko" out in katakana.::
10628::$$$message_0082_0016_0000$$$::I stack the things in Ms. Neko's car.[lr]::
10629::$$$message_0082_0016_0001$$$::It's a big automobile originally bought for transporting alcohol, so we're able to store the plywood and square timber without a problem.::
10630::$$$message_0082_0017_0000$$$::"Good work. You're all done for today.[lr]::
10631::$$$message_0082_0017_0001$$$::Mm, I'll take you home while I'm at it."[lr]::
10632::$$$message_0082_0017_0002$$$::"Thank you. Can you drop me off past the bridge, please?[lr]::
10633::$$$message_0082_0017_0003$$$::I need to stop by the shopping district to get things for dinner."::
10634::$$$message_0082_0018_0000$$$::"Really?[wvl canskip=0 time=800] I was thinking of treating you to dinner, but if you have plans, that's fine. You are the mom of a big family after all."[lr]::
10635::$$$message_0082_0018_0001$$$::"...Not really the way I'd phrase it, but I'll accept the consideration as intended.[lr]::
10636::$$$message_0082_0018_0002$$$::You say treating me to dinner, but you mean Kitamura Chaya, right?" ::
10637::$$$message_0082_0019_0000$$$::"You can see right through me, huh? But you can't take the recent Kitamura Chaya lightly. The taste went up, prices went down, service got worse, and there's some weird scary story haunting it."[lr]::
10638::$$$message_0082_0019_0001$$$::"...Weird story? What's that, Ms. Neko?"::
10639::$$$message_0082_0020_0000$$$::"I don't know much about it either. It's what I heard from Furumi, but a super beautiful young woman appears past midnight. [l][say storage=sch0118_cat_0151 name=ネコ]She orders for two people even though she's by herself, and she consumes it before you realize.[lr]::
10640::$$$message_0082_0020_0001$$$::Then, when the employee who receives the payment looks up, there's no one there."::
10641::$$$message_0082_0021_0000$$$::"I see... Um, it's hard to tell whether it's scary or not."[lr]::
10642::$$$message_0082_0021_0001$$$::"Huh? Why not?"[lr]::
10643::$$$message_0082_0021_0002$$$::"She's beautiful, right? Then that's something positive. It's not like she haunts you. It's polite if she disappears after paying too."::
10644::$$$message_0082_0022_0000$$$::"...Hmm. I think a ghost that pays money is more scary than a ghost that haunts. Ghosts are always just intangible, right?[l][say storage=sch0118_cat_0171 name=ネコ] Then they're not scary or anything, but if they can pay, that means they can be interacted with, which means you can get in a fist fight with them, and you'll die if hit somewhere vital.[lr]::
10645::$$$message_0082_0022_0001$$$::That isn't even a ghost anymore. [wvl canskip=0 time=900]Well, it's fine though. As long as that girl isn't a drunkard."::
10646::$$$message_0082_0023_0000$$$::...I see, so there's that way of thinking.[lr]::
10647::$$$message_0082_0023_0001$$$::Ghosts aren't supposed to be seen by humans.[lr]::
10648::$$$message_0082_0023_0002$$$::As long as they can't be seen, it doesn't matter whether their manners are good or not.[lr]::
10649::$$$message_0082_0023_0003$$$::But, it's a different story if they actually follow human rules.[lr]::
10650::$$$message_0082_0023_0004$$$::That isn't a ghost anymore.[lr]::
10651::$$$message_0082_0023_0005$$$::That is none other than a human that can do harm to other living beings.::
10652::$$$message_0082_0024_0000$$$::...For example.[lr]::
10653::$$$message_0082_0024_0001$$$::An unknown woman that wanders about during the night...::
10654::$$$message_0082_0025_0000$$$::"...Hey Ms. Neko, can I meet that employee who saw that ghost[line len=2]?"[lr]::
10655::$$$message_0082_0025_0001$$$::"Oh? Is that Otoko and Shirou?"::
10656::$$$message_0082_0026_0000$$$::"So it is![lr]::
10657::$$$message_0082_0026_0001$$$::What are you two doing here? It's still during working hours, right? Copenhagen should be further into the backstreets near the industrial area, right?"::
10658::$$$message_0082_0027_0000$$$::"Fujimura, you're forgetting our promise."[lr]::
10659::$$$message_0082_0027_0001$$$::"Huh? Come on, I paid my debt from the other time. There's nothing else... Wait...[cacheimage storage=藤08b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=藤08b(中)]oh.[lr]::
10660::$$$message_0082_0027_0002$$$::Oh yeah, I forgot because it was so sudden. Sorry, sorry. Can you just turn a blind eye like usual?"::
10661::$$$message_0082_0028_0000$$$::"As if I can do that![lr]::
10662::$$$message_0082_0028_0001$$$::First of all, we made this kind of promise because of your nonsense. Emiyan doesn't know yet, so I said not to say any unnecessary things."::
10663::$$$message_0082_0029_0000$$$::"Huh? No way, Shirou doesn't know? Even though you've known each other for five years already?[lr]::
10664::$$$message_0082_0029_0001$$$::...Wow, I can't believe it. I'm impressed I kept quiet for so long."[lr]::
10665::$$$message_0082_0029_0002$$$::"Well, I found out that Emiyan is your sworn brother a year ago. You also found out that Emiyan is working at our place a year ago too, right?[lr]::
10666::$$$message_0082_0029_0003$$$::Right, Emiyan?"::
10667::$$$message_0082_0030_0000$$$::"Yeah. Fuji-nee started telling me to go get some sake. They don't sell it at regular stores, so I unwillingly cycled all the way to Copenhagen, and then she was asking me why I went to Neko's."::
10668::$$$message_0082_0031_0000$$$::"Oh, oh. That's right, that's right.[lr]::
10669::$$$message_0082_0031_0001$$$::Did I go straight to Neko's after that?"[lr]::
10670::$$$message_0082_0031_0002$$$::"Carrying your bamboo sword. I was a humanities student, yet I couldn't even imagine I would be raided by Fuyuki City's tiger.[lr]::
10671::$$$message_0082_0031_0003$$$::You should be thankful, Fujimura. Had Emiyan not stopped us, we both wouldn't have been able to stay in this world."::
10672::$$$message_0082_0032_0000$$$::...Hahaha.[lr]::
10673::$$$message_0082_0032_0001$$$::She means that one of them would be behind bars as a murderer, and the other would be in a hospital bed or in a grave.[lr]::
10674::$$$message_0082_0032_0002$$$::I'll withhold the name of which one started it for their honor, but other than that, Ms. Neko has my absolute obedience.::
10675::$$$message_0082_0033_0000$$$::"Humph, you were completely at fault for that.[lr]::
10676::$$$message_0082_0033_0001$$$::I regretted not bringing my real sword when I heard that he'd actually been working there for four years.[lr]::
10677::$$$message_0082_0033_0002$$$::You're at fault too, Shirou. Why did it have to be a liquor store of all places? Copenhagen even turns into a pub at night. You knew that's the hangout for Homurahara's alumni and the nest of cougars where she-devils gather."::
10678::$$$message_0082_0034_0000$$$::"I didn't. First of all, all of our customers are decent. You're the only one who is dangerous among the Homurahara alumni."[lr]::
10679::$$$message_0082_0034_0001$$$::"Oh, well said, Emiyan! As expected from the rising star that bears the future of Copenhagen![cacheimage storage=ネコ01a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ネコ01a(中)] Good boy, come work here after you graduate. I shall turn you into a super bartender of my type!"::
10680::$$$message_0082_0035_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
10681::$$$message_0082_0035_0001$$$::She pulls my left arm.::
10682::$$$message_0082_0036_0000$$$::"Don't be ridiculous, Otoko. I won't approve of that as his teacher and guardian![lr]::
10683::$$$message_0082_0036_0001$$$::Shirou is going to pursue higher education, so I won't let him take such an unconventional yet cool path in life!"[lr]::
10684::$$$message_0082_0036_0002$$$::"Huuuh?"[lr]::
10685::$$$message_0082_0036_0003$$$::She pulls my right arm.::
10686::$$$message_0082_0037_0000$$$::"Mrgh, you have no learning ability either, Fujimura![lr]::
10687::$$$message_0082_0037_0001$$$::What is he going to become after pursuing higher education? Can't you tell that it'd be a waste to throw him into education!?[lr]::
10688::$$$message_0082_0037_0002$$$::You're a good example of that!"::
10689::$$$message_0082_0038_0000$$$::"That's my line, stupid Otoko![lr]::
10690::$$$message_0082_0038_0001$$$::You good-for-nothing that threw away everything by being a workaholic despite being the smartest one![lr]::
10691::$$$message_0082_0038_0002$$$::We all looked up to you, [cacheimage storage=藤08d(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤08d(近)]yet you casually dropped out [cacheimage storage=藤03a(近)b][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=藤03a(近)b][shock vmax=15 time=400 count=3]saying 'I'm quitting because it's a lot of work, hehe[whitestar]'!!![wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=15 time=400 count=4] And you set up a flour bomb in my desk in the very end!!!"::
10692::$$$message_0082_0039_0000$$$::This sure is a thing.[lr]::
10693::$$$message_0082_0039_0001$$$::Please stop. Don't air all your dirty laundry here.::
10694::$$$message_0082_0040_0000$$$::"What? You should be grateful that I didn't set it at your house![lr]::
10695::$$$message_0082_0040_0001$$$::First of all, ever since you went and weirdly pronounced my name on national TV, my youth had no boys in it!"::
10696::$$$message_0082_0041_0000$$$::"Why not!? Otoko is a lovely name! Yet you made me promise to call you Neko in front of others![cacheimage storage=藤03a頬(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤03a頬(近)] Do you want to trade names, huh!?"::
10697::$$$message_0082_0042_0000$$$::"Ha, no thanks! If I were to trade names, I'd rather trade names with Mr. Gai from District 3!"::
10698::$$$message_0082_0043_0000$$$::Wooo[wait canskip=0 time=400]w.[lr]::
10699::$$$message_0082_0043_0001$$$::Fuji-nee is, well, within her tolerable range I guess, but...[lr]::
10700::$$$message_0082_0043_0002$$$::It's the first time that I've seen Ms. Neko this crazy.[lr]::
10701::$$$message_0082_0043_0003$$$::...I see, I didn't know she was actually a cultured person and capable of polite speech.::
10702::$$$message_0082_0044_0000$$$::Wait, no, this is bad, bad, bad![lr]::
10703::$$$message_0082_0044_0001$$$::Do the two of them know that all three of us soon "won't be able to stay in this world" like this?::
10704::$$$message_0082_0045_0000$$$::"Mm, as expected from a woman who spent her teens carrying beer bottles and dumbbells! I wonder if it's true that there was lead in the reference book!"[cacheimage storage=white][wvs][movefg opacity=255 left=0 top=0 time=100 accel=0 storage=white textoff=0][wm canskip=0][se storage=se707.wav][shock vmax=15 time=400 count=3][movefg opacity=0 left=0 top=0 time=200 accel=0 storage=white textoff=0][wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=255 left=0 top=0 time=200 accel=0 storage=white textoff=0][wm canskip=0][se storage=se707.wav][shock vmax=15 time=400 count=3][movefg opacity=0 left=0 top=0 time=300 accel=0 storage=white textoff=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
10705::$$$message_0082_0045_0001$$$::"Wha[line len=2]Those groundless rumors were all you, huh!?[lr]::
10706::$$$message_0082_0045_0002$$$::You're the only one I told that my arm strength is from helping out at the store!"::
10707::$$$message_0082_0046_0000$$$::They're literally like a wildcat and tiger.[lr]::
10708::$$$message_0082_0046_0001$$$::I'm sandwiched between two fierce animals, and both my shoulders came right out.[lr]::
10709::$$$message_0082_0046_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
10710::$$$message_0082_0046_0003$$$::Ah... I got used to the pain, but it's numbing for both shoulders to get dislocated; my consciousness is fading away...::
10711::$$$message_0082_0047_0000$$$::"Oh? Shirou, why are your arms stretching? Are they rubber? Did you eat some weird fruit?"[lr]::
10712::$$$message_0082_0047_0001$$$::"AHHHH!!!???[lr]::
10713::$$$message_0082_0047_0002$$$::Fujimura, call the ambulance, the ambulance...![lr]::
10714::$$$message_0082_0047_0003$$$::E-Emiyan's shoulders got dislocated...!"[lr]::
10715::$$$message_0082_0047_0004$$$::"Ugh, you're such a drama queen, Otoko. It's just dislocated shoulders, right?"::
10716::$$$message_0082_0048_0000$$$::Ahh... I have a really bad feeling.[lr]::
10717::$$$message_0082_0048_0001$$$::Stop her. Someone stop that tiger, please.::
10718::$$$message_0082_0049_0000$$$::"It's not like he's fallen apart.[lr]::
10719::$$$message_0082_0049_0001$$$::Look, watch closely, Otoko. [wvl canskip=0 time=200]Something like this, [wvl canskip=0 time=200]you just[line len=2]"[lr]::
10720::$$$message_0082_0049_0002$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
10721::$$$message_0082_0049_0003$$$::"Don't 'huh' meeeee!!![lr]::
10722::$$$message_0082_0049_0004$$$::Oh no no no, Emiyan's mouth turned into beer[line len=2][wvl canskip=0 time=200]no[line len=2][wvl canskip=0 time=200]Emiyan's mouth turned into a foaming, spilling beer tap...!"::
10723::$$$message_0082_0050_0000$$$::Haha... That's why I said that you never know where a dead end trap is hiding[wait canskip=0 time=400]...[wait canskip=0 time=400] [wait canskip=0 time=200]I collapse.::
910682::$$$message_9082_0036_0000$$$::"Don't be ridiculous, Otoko. I won't approve of that as his teacher and guardian!"::Fp